🔹 1. Collection
________________________________________________________________
-A collection is a group of objects.
-It allows you to handle many objects together, instead of one by one.
-Helps store, access, and manage objects easily.
-Examples:
A classroom of students
A basket of fruits
A list of books
-is like a putting many things into one container.
